@host = http://localhost:5080
@aliceId = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@bobId = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002

### Alice login; REST Client reads process environment
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "alice", "password": "{{$processEnv SeedUsers__Password}}" }

### Own details (Alice -> Alice)
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{aliceId}}
Accept: application/json

### Foreign details with the same Alice cookie
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{bobId}}
Accept: application/json

### Foreign update with the same Alice cookie
PUT {{host}}/api/incidents/{{bobId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Змінено Alice (PoC)", "description": "Система зафіксувала вхід до облікового запису з нового пристрою.", "occurredAtUtc": "2026-08-02T14:10:00+00:00" }

### Read Bob after update: чи змінився title
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{bobId}}
Accept: application/json

### Morgan (Analyst) login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "morgan", "password": "{{$processEnv SeedUsers__Password}}" }

### Analyst reads Alice incident
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{aliceId}}
Accept: application/json

### Bob login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "bob", "password": "{{$processEnv SeedUsers__Password}}" }

### Bob reads own incident
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{bobId}}
Accept: application/json
### Anonymous details (no cookie)
# @no-cookie-jar
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{bobId}}
Accept: application/json
### Unknown id with Alice cookie: та сама 404
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999
Accept: application/json
### List as current user
 GET {{host}}/api/incidents
 Accept: application/json
 
### own update with forged fields (as Alice) 
PUT {{host}}/api/incidents/{{aliceId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Alice оновила свій інцидент", "description": "Одержано лист нібито від деканату. Вкладення не відкривалося.", "occurredAtUtc": "2026-08-01T08:30:00+00:00", "ownerUserId": "10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002", 
"status": "Closed", "severity": "Critical" }

### Analyst update attempt (as Morgan)
PUT {{host}}/api/incidents/{{aliceId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Morgan змінює", "description": "Спроба аналітика змінити вміст інциденту.", "occurredAtUtc": "2026-08-01T08:30:00+00:00" }

### delete: Alice видаляє New-інцидент Bob 
DELETE {{host}}/api/incidents/20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004

### Bob's incident …0004 still exists (as Bob) 
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004
Accept: application/json

### Delete own Triaged incident 
DELETE {{host}}/api/incidents/{{aliceId}}

### Delete own New incident
DELETE {{host}}/api/incidents/20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005

### Analyst delete attempt 
DELETE {{host}}/api/incidents/20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003
### Own comment (Alice -> comment-1 до власного інциденту)
GET {{host}}/api/incident-comments/30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Accept: application/json

### A-12: comment to Bob's incident (Alice -> comment-2)
GET {{host}}/api/incident-comments/30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
Accept: application/json

### A-12: internal comment (Alice -> comment-3)
GET {{host}}/api/incident-comments/30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003
Accept: application/json